# Social + love: an open candidate, no record. Only the love side is computed. Read-only on culture/love.
seq profiles = from culture/love/fingerprints.json "preference profiles"
claim formula profiles = "((n!)**n)**2" from 1
claim profiles = [1, 16, 46656]
frame "Candidate: preference profiles of culture/love (n + n people, each ranks the other side) and Condorcet profiles of culture/social (voters rank options)" reading "ANALOGY (a reading): one side of a love profile reads as n voters ranking n options. Only the love side is checked here: 1, 16, 46656 = ((n!)^n)^2 for n = 1..3. culture/social/condorcet.py counts 3 voters on 3 or 4 options, not n voters on n options, so it meets this formula only at n = 3 (216); a social count for n = 1..3 is needed; open" -> none label open reach 2 cost 40
